OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Don't ask me to print your
OL,4,AChatGPT birthday card': Hitting back at
OL,5,AAI 'slop'
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen they first started appearing, it
OL,8,Fwas hard to tell where they were coming
OL,9,Ffrom, these posters, flyers and food
OL,10,Fmenus that all looked like they had
OL,11,Frolled off the same industrial printing
OL,12,Fpress.
OL,14,FBelfast was awash with them during
OL,15,FFleadh Cheoil na hEireann this month,
OL,16,Fbut by that time most people had them
OL,17,Fsussed out.
OL,19,F"More AI," they sighed, glancing at a
OL,20,Fcaricatured guitarist on a gig poster
OL,21,For an abnormally glistening burger on a
OL,22,Fmenu.
